# Coleção de requisições do MiniCâmbio (VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client ou Visual Studio).
# Suba o ambiente antes: docker compose up --build -d

@orders = http://localhost:5000
@rates = http://localhost:5001
@payments = http://localhost:5002
@web = http://localhost:3000

######################################################################## Rates

### Lista as taxas de todas as moedas (variação de ±1% a cada chamada)
GET {{rates}}/api/v1/rates

### Taxa de uma moeda
GET {{rates}}/api/v1/rates/USD

### Moeda inexistente → 404
GET {{rates}}/api/v1/rates/XYZ

### Emite uma cotação (válida por 60 s)
# @name quote
POST {{rates}}/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: requests-http-quote

{
  "currency": "USD",
  "side": "Buy",
  "foreignAmount": 1000.00
}

### Consulta a cotação emitida acima (isExpired vira true depois de 60 s)
GET {{rates}}/api/v1/quotes/{{quote.response.body.$.id}}

### Cotação inválida → 400 com erros por campo
POST {{rates}}/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "usd",
  "side": "Hold",
  "foreignAmount": 0
}

### Moeda não suportada → 422
POST {{rates}}/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "side": "Sell",
  "foreignAmount": 10
}

######################################################################## Payments
# Normalmente quem chama o Payments é o Orders; aqui dá para exercitar o serviço isolado.

### Solicita um pagamento → 202 Pending (repetir com o mesmo orderId devolve 200 com o mesmo pagamento)
# @name payment
POST {{payments}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "0192f0c4-1111-7000-8000-000000000001",
  "currency": "USD",
  "foreignAmount": 1000.00,
  "beneficiary": {
    "name": "Maria Silva",
    "country": "BR",
    "accountNumber": "123456789"
  }
}

### Consulta o pagamento (Pending → Processing → Completed em alguns segundos)
GET {{payments}}/api/v1/payments/{{payment.response.body.$.id}}

### Consulta o pagamento de uma ordem
GET {{payments}}/api/v1/payments?orderId=0192f0c4-1111-7000-8000-000000000001

### Pagamento que o mock recusa (nome contém FAIL → BENEFICIARY_REJECTED)
POST {{payments}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{$guid}}",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "foreignAmount": 50.00,
  "beneficiary": {
    "name": "FAIL Teste",
    "country": "PT",
    "accountNumber": "PT50000201231234567890154"
  }
}

######################################################################## Orders

### Cria uma ordem (fica Quoted por 60 s)
# @name order
POST {{orders}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "currency": "USD",
  "side": "Buy",
  "foreignAmount": 1000.00,
  "beneficiary": {
    "name": "Maria Silva",
    "country": "BR",
    "accountNumber": "123456789"
  }
}

### Consulta a ordem (canConfirm/canCancel dizem quais ações são possíveis)
GET {{orders}}/api/v1/orders/{{order.response.body.$.id}}

### Confirma a ordem → solicita o pagamento (PaymentRequested → Completed)
POST {{orders}}/api/v1/orders/{{order.response.body.$.id}}/confirm

### Cancela a ordem → 204 (só enquanto Quoted; depois de confirmada → 422)
DELETE {{orders}}/api/v1/orders/{{order.response.body.$.id}}

### Lista paginada, da mais recente para a mais antiga
GET {{orders}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&pageSize=20

### Lista filtrada por status
GET {{orders}}/api/v1/orders?status=Completed&page=1&pageSize=10

### Sem Idempotency-Key → 400
POST {{orders}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "USD",
  "side": "Buy",
  "foreignAmount": 10,
  "beneficiary": { "name": "Maria Silva", "country": "BR", "accountNumber": "123" }
}

### Mesma Idempotency-Key duas vezes → a segunda devolve 200 com a mesma ordem
POST {{orders}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: requests-http-idempotente-1

{
  "currency": "EUR",
  "side": "Sell",
  "foreignAmount": 250.50,
  "beneficiary": { "name": "João Souza", "country": "PT", "accountNumber": "PT50000201231234567890154" }
}

### Moeda não suportada pelo Rates → 422
POST {{orders}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "side": "Buy",
  "foreignAmount": 10,
  "beneficiary": { "name": "Maria Silva", "country": "BR", "accountNumber": "123" }
}

######################################################################## Health checks

### Live (sem dependências)
GET {{orders}}/health/live

### Ready (inclui o banco)
GET {{orders}}/health/ready

### Rates ready
GET {{rates}}/health/ready

### Payments ready
GET {{payments}}/health/ready

######################################################################## Web (nginx)

### Health do container web
GET {{web}}/healthz

### Proxy do nginx para o Orders
GET {{web}}/api/v1/orders

### Fallback de SPA (devolve o index.html)
GET {{web}}/orders/qualquer-coisa
